00:43:01,170 --> 00:43:04,460
Most amnesic patients are like this man.

1131
00:43:04,460 --> 00:43:06,570
Very intelligent, very verbal.

1132
00:43:06,570 --> 00:43:10,280
Not dramatic, but with terribly impaired memory.

1133
00:43:21,100 --> 00:43:24,510
So last part of the talk is this idea of memory systems

1134
00:43:24,510 --> 00:43:27,250
and procedural memory, the idea that you're a symphony of

1135
00:43:27,250 --> 00:43:28,880
the neural systems that learn different things.

