00:45:03,740 --> 00:45:06,350
I just have to go 45 degrees difference.

1185
00:45:06,350 --> 00:45:07,080
I can do it.

1186
00:45:07,080 --> 00:45:09,340
And you're controlling your hand, but then you move again

1187
00:45:09,340 --> 00:45:10,420
