00:46:02,180 --> 00:46:02,970
I'm awesome.

1217
00:46:02,970 --> 00:46:04,560
Just let me at it.

1218
00:46:04,560 --> 00:46:06,110
Because you know that you did it.

1219
00:46:06,110 --> 00:46:07,890
You know how good you are through practice.

1220
00:46:07,890 --> 00:46:11,180
He has no idea, but his learning is entirely normal.

1221
00:46:11,180 --> 00:46:13,290
Not just better than you'd think?

1222
00:46:13,290 --> 00:46:15,240
Just as good as you.

1223
00:46:15,240 --> 00:46:18,610
So a memory system in his brain, different than the

1224
00:46:18,610 --> 00:46:22,600
