1225
00:46:22,600 --> 00:46:24,670
And the amazing thing is that this means that that's also

1226
00:46:24,670 --> 00:46:27,090
true in you, as far as we understand these things.

1227
00:46:27,090 --> 00:46:30,570
When you learn a physical or mental skill, a lot of it is

